mit instead of one each.\n- **Port clash:** one test run hit `EADDRINUSE` on port 8123 because another worktree was testing; a retry fixed it.\n\nI also added a paragraph to `AGENTS.md` about the control properties and how to write \"bound value wins\" tests that can actually fail.","ttft_ms":2414,"type":"result","duration_ms":201294,"uuid":"e3458b49-6d16-4ce6-b306-59da1963607c","ttft_stream_ms":1490,"time_to_request_ms":96,"first_content_frame_ms":1490,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
